          "content": [
            {
              "type": "tool_use",
              "id": "toolu_01FRBfm8uPY1dBuq9Bf6LWiH",
              "name": "ScheduleWakeup",
              "input": {
                "delaySeconds": 180,
                "reason": "等待 v9 数据收集，当前 25/28/22 条，目标每GPU 50条",
                "prompt": "## 任务：等 v9 达到 ~50 条/GPU 后采样 SR 和数据分布\n\n### 背景\n服务器 cqa1-21977 上 v9 数据收集运行中（3 GPU），当前约 10+ 条。需要等每个 GPU 产出 ~50 条后做一次详细采样。\n\n### 你要做的\n\n**Step 1: 等待数据量够**（ssh_read_only 轮询）\n\n每 3 分钟检查一次各 GPU 的输出行数：\n```bash\ncd /root/autodl-tmp/rl-active-probe-fl\nfor dir in data/trajectories_v9_icl_cuda0 data/trajectories_v9_icl_cuda1 data/trajectories_v9_icl_cuda4; do\n  f=$(ls $dir/*.jsonl 2>/dev/null | head -1)\n  [ -n \"$f\" ] && echo \"$dir: $(wc -l < $f) lines\" || echo \"$dir: no file\"\ndone\n```\n\n当**至少 2 个 GPU 达到 50 条**时，进入 Step 2。不要等太久——如果 10 分钟内都没达到，就用当前数据做（哪怕只有 30 条也行）。\n\n**Step 2: 详细分析**（ssh_read_only）\n\n```bash\ncd /root/autodl-tmp/rl-active-probe-fl\npython3 -c \"\nimport json, glob, sys\nfrom collections import Counter, defaultdict\n\nfiles = glob.glob('data/trajectories_v9_icl_cuda*/train*.jsonl') + glob.glob('data/trajectories_v9_icl_cuda*/*.jsonl')\nfiles = list(set(files))\n\nall_data = []\nfor f in sorted(files):\n    with open(f) as fh:\n        for line in fh:\n            all_data.append(json.loads(line))\n\ntotal = len(all_data)\nsuccess = sum(1 for d in all_data if d.get('reward', False))\nfailure = total - success\nprint(f'总计: {total} | 成功: {success} | 失败: {failure} | SR: {success/max(total,1)*100:.1f}%')\nprint()\n\n# 按 task_type 分布\ntt_total = Counter()\ntt_success = Counter()\ntt_steps = defaultdict(list)\nfor d in all_data:\n    tt = d.get('task_type', 'unknown')\n    tt_total[tt] += 1\n    if d.get('reward', False):\n        tt_success[tt] += 1\n    tt_steps[tt].append(d.get('steps', 0))\n\nprint('按 task_type:')\nfor tt in sorted(tt_total, key=lambda x: tt_total[x], reverse=True):\n    sr = tt_success[tt] / tt_total[tt] * 100\n    avg_steps = sum(tt_steps[tt]) / len(tt_steps[tt])\n    print(f'  {tt}: {tt_success[tt]}/{tt_total[tt]} ({sr:.0f}%) avg_steps={avg_steps:.1f}')\n\n# 失败轨迹的 divergence point 分析\n# divergence point = 失败轨迹与 expert 开始不同的步数\n# 这需要 expert 数据对比，暂时用 steps 分布代替\nprint()\nfail_steps = [d['steps'] for d in all_data if not d.get('reward', False)]\nif fail_steps:\n    import statistics\n    print(f'失败轨迹步数: mean={statistics.mean(fail_steps):.1f}, median={statistics.median(fail_steps):.0f}, min={min(fail_steps)}, max={max(fail_steps)}')\n    # 步数分布\n    bins = {'1-10': 0, '11-20': 0, '21-30': 0, '31-40': 0}\n    for s in fail_steps:\n        if s <= 10: bins['1-10'] += 1\n        elif s <= 20: bins['11-20'] += 1\n        elif s <= 30: bins['21-30'] += 1\n        else: bins['31-40'] += 1\n    print(f'  步数分布: {dict(bins)}')\n\nsucc_steps = [d['steps'] for d in all_data if d.get('reward', False)]\nif succ_steps:\n    print(f'成功轨迹步数: mean={statistics.mean(succ_steps):.1f}, median={statistics.median(succ_steps):.0f}')\nprint()\nprint(f'P2 可行性预判: 失败 {failure} 条中，需要与 expert 匹配构建 DPO pairs。')\nprint(f'按 v5 经验 ~83% match rate，预估可构建 ~{int(failure*0.83)} DPO pairs。')\nprint(f'3 GPU 各 300 条: 预估总失败 ~{int(900*(1-success/max(total,1)))} 条 → ~{int(900*(1-success/max(total,1))*0.83)} DPO pairs。')\n\"\n```\n\n**Step 3: 汇报**\n输出简洁报告包含：\n- 整体 SR（对比 v6 baseline 63%）\n- 按 task_type SR 分布\n- 平均步数\n- 失败轨迹步数分布\n- P2 DPO pairs 预估数量\n- 是否有异常（某 task_type SR 异常低等）\n\n### 环境\n- 服务器：cqa1-21977\n- conda base\n- 项目路径：/root/autodl-tmp/rl-active-probe-fl\n\n### 进度\n- 第 1 次检查 (T+0): cuda0=25, cuda1=28, cuda4=22, 总计75条。未达标。\n- 10分钟超时时间从第一次检查开始算，也就是如果到第4次检查仍未达标，就用当前数据做分析。"
              },
              "caller": {
